  "notes": "<p>Born in Chobham, grew up a townie kid who figured out the older students would let her hang around if she impressed them with stunts and tumbling tricks.</p><p>Followed a rich friend to Teek, took gigs entertaining for the Great Houses there. Witnessed an assassination during a performance and sprang into action without thinking much about it. She caught the assassin and it opened doors for her (higher-paying security-detail gigs), but whoever sent that first assassin wants her dead.</p>",
